   "text": "Edinburgh Napier university International College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nEdinburgh Napier university International College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nEdinburgh Napier University International College (ENUIC) is an embedded on-campus college for international students to start their studies at Edinburgh Napier University. The International College is located in the historic city centre Merchiston campus, with easy access to student accommodation. At Edinburgh Napier University International College students are given the support and encouragement to build a firm foundation for future success in a diverse range of degree programmes. Students can choose to study International Stage One, International Stage Two, or an International Incorporated Master's.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n11/06/2026 08:09\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 09:18\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £14,895.00\nMin: £8,695.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n50%\n7,000 of 14,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nOIEG (Oxford International Education Group)\nFounded Year\n1992\nCampus(es)\nEdinburgh\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n08/02/2024\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.napier.ac.uk/study-with-us/accommodation\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8hbIRycDWPE\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
